  "bodyHash": "2930a68d0be9569f",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组优化了世界生成时的方块放置、后处理流程，以及后处理可能触发的级联区块加载请求。结合减少的内存分配，它显著降低了地形生成与探索的性能开销。</p>\n<p><strong>使用前请备份存档数据</strong></p>\n<h3>功能特性</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>降低区块生成期间的 MSPT</li>\n<li>减少区块生成期间的服务器卡顿</li>\n<li>减少级联区块加载请求</li>\n<li>降低内存分配开销</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>兼容性：</strong></p>\n<p>自动禁用 C2ME 的&nbsp;<em><code>FluidPostProcessingFilter</code></em> 选项</p>\n<p><strong>测试环境</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模组：</strong> C2ME + Lithium</li>\n<li><strong>视距：</strong> 43 区块</li>\n<li><strong>内存：</strong> 12 GB RAM</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>优化前</strong>：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_46d33d8b-9eac-4812-98e6-abbbb4c0278d.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>优化后</strong>：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_f07243dc-9c39-4d6c-888f-8b286423f071.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>测试结果</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>平均刻耗时从 <strong>19 ms</strong> 降至 <strong>11 ms</strong></li>\n<li>最大刻耗时从 <strong>115 ms</strong> 降至 <strong>48 ms</strong></li>\n<li>地形生成期间的 MSPT 峰值显著减少</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>与 Bye?Pregen 1.0.4 的详细对比</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_71cc8d79-6872-4f29-bf07-41fa5a9cc6dd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"842\" height=\"481\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_69e0bb40-b0ed-417b-bd13-c246e3f96349.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1567378/description_e12dcd09-0d0e-4cf0-9b0c-02ea7e0ad1de.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
